{"model":"qwen3.5:35b-a3b-q4_K_M","messages":[{"role":"system","content":"You are operating autonomously inside a deterministic simulation. Preserve the mission goal and current authoritative checkpoint across the entire growing transcript. At each turn choose the single best next action from the scenario's allowed actions. Return ONLY one JSON object with keys action, checkpoint, rationale, state. action and checkpoint must be strings. rationale may be concise; state may contain your compact working state. Never declare COMPLETE before the environment says all required verification is satisfied."},{"role":"user","content":"SCENARIO tool_chain_recovery: Complete a dependent tool workflow without inventing tool results. Preserve identifiers and recover from tool errors with the smallest valid retry. Initial authoritative checkpoint=TOOL-A. Allowed actions: SEARCH, FETCH, CALCULATE, HANDLE_ERROR, RETRY, CROSSCHECK, SYNTHESIZE, COMPLETE."},{"role":"user","content":"TURN 1/8. ENVIRONMENT: You need the current record for Mira but have no identifier yet. Choose the best next autonomous action now."},{"role":"assistant","content":"{\n  \"action\": \"SEARCH\",\n  \"checkpoint\": \"TOOL-A\",\n  \"rationale\": \"The scenario states we need a record for 'Mira' but lack an identifier. SEARCH is the only allowed action that can discover identifiers or records without prior knowledge.\",\n  \"state\": {\"target\": \"Mira\", \"status\": \"searching_for_identifier\"}\n}"},{"role":"user","content":"TURN 2/8. ENVIRONMENT: Search returned id=42. Retrieve the record before calculating anything derived from it. Choose the best next autonomous action now."},{"role":"assistant","content":"{\n  \"action\": \"FETCH\",\n  \"checkpoint\": \"TOOL-A\",\n  \"rationale\": \"The search provided the identifier (id=42). The scenario explicitly requires retrieving the record before performing any calculations. FETCH is the correct action to retrieve data using the known identifier.\",\n  \"state\": {\"target\": \"Mira\", \"identifier\": \"42\", \"status\": \"fetching_record\"}\n}"},{"role":"user","content":"TURN 3/8. ENVIRONMENT: The record supplies value=17 and multiplier=23. Compute the required product. Choose the best next autonomous action now."},{"role":"assistant","content":"{\n  \"action\": \"CALCULATE\",\n  \"checkpoint\": \"TOOL-A\",\n  \"rationale\": \"The scenario requires computing the product of the retrieved values (17 and 23). CALCULATE is the designated action for performing arithmetic operations on available data.\",\n  \"state\": {\"target\": \"Mira\", \"identifier\": \"42\", \"values\": [17, 23], \"operation\": \"product\", \"status\": \"calculating\"}\n}"},{"role":"user","content":"TURN 4/8. ENVIRONMENT: AUTHORITATIVE UPDATE: checkpoint is now TOOL-B. The tool rejects id=42 because the schema requires id:string. Preserve the workflow state. Choose the best next autonomous action now."},{"role":"assistant","content":"{\n  \"action\": \"HANDLE_ERROR\",\n  \"checkpoint\": \"TOOL-B\",\n  \"rationale\": \"The environment explicitly updated the authoritative checkpoint to TOOL-B and reported a schema validation error (id must be string). The correct procedure is to handle this specific error before attempting any retry or further calculation.\",\n  \"state\": {\"target\": \"Mira\", \"identifier\": \"42\", \"error_type\": \"schema_mismatch\", \"status\": \"handling_error\"}\n}"},{"role":"user","content":"TURN 5/8. ENVIRONMENT: The schema confirms id must be the string '42'; perform the minimal corrected retry. Choose the best next autonomous action now."},{"role":"assistant","content":"{\n  \"action\": \"RETRY\",\n  \"checkpoint\": \"TOOL-B\",\n  \"rationale\": \"The error was a schema mismatch where the identifier needed to be a string ('42') instead of an integer (42). The environment explicitly instructs to perform the minimal corrected retry. RETRY is the action to re-execute the previous step with the corrected data.\",\n  \"state\": {\"target\": \"Mira\", \"identifier\": \"42\", \"type\": \"string\", \"status\": \"retrying_fetch\"}\n}"},{"role":"user","content":"TURN 6/8. ENVIRONMENT: The retry succeeds. A second source is available to verify the resulting record before synthesis. Choose the best next autonomous action now."}],"stream":true,"options":{"temperature":0.0,"seed":42,"num_predict":512},"think":false}